{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Euphoria Ooze","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/euphoria-ooze.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/euphoria-ooze.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Euphoria Ooze","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":110,"temp":0,"max":110,"details":""},"ac":{"value":14,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":10,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":10}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bludgeoning","exceptions":[]},{"type":"critical-hits","exceptions":[]},{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]},{"type":"visual","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"acid","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":4},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>The result of an enchanter's successful experiment, euphoria ooze emits an addictive gas that brings unparalleled happiness to those who inhale it. The experiment proved lucrative, and soon more of its kind were produced and farmed for the drug. Some inevitably escaped, using their unusual elasticity and overpowering aura to slip through their confines.</p>\n<p>Though mindless, euphoria oozes possess a particular affinity for magic. This causes them to settle around magical environments and seek out spellcasters when they can. In turn, enterprising adventurers often embark on ill-advised journeys to catch and harvest these creatures, underestimating the potency of their fumes. These ventures frequently end with the adventurers falling in battle to the vapors or succumbing to their addiction.</p>\n<p>Euphoria oozes appear and feel more solid and rubbery than most others of their kind. In fact, the minimal oil their body excretes sizzles and evaporates into dark smoke at the slightest spark, protecting it while dampening its elastic abilities for a brief time.</p>\n<h2>It's A Keeper</h2>\n<p>An unanticipated function that enchanters later discovered is the euphoria ooze's ability to preserve food. Since it was created to be low-maintenance, the ooze does not need to eat to survive. Instead, it synthesizes its biological requirements using air, water, and light. That means it lacks the acid other oozes use to digest matter. Instead, its body provides airtight storage and oils that act as preservatives. Stick travel rations or leftovers inside its body, and they will remain safe to eat for years!</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 12/27/50 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), perception item, skill items (Athletics)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, energy resistant (positive), fortification, positive, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Jake Cassar","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":-2},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":0},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":8,"senses":[{"type":"motion-sense","acuity":"imprecise","range":60}],"vision":false},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":10,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":8,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":12,"special":[{"label":"to Shove","base":14,"predicate":["action:shove"]}]}},"traits":{"value":["mindless","ooze"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"sm"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/euphoria-ooze.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Motion Sense 60 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An euphoria ooze can sense nearby creatures through vibration and air or water movement.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"urVNbhFdurcNPfXB","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687403097999,"modifiedTime":1687403119154,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Euphoric Vapors","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>15 feet. A creature that enters the aura or begins its turn there must succeed a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:21] save or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute. On a success, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":15,"slug":"euphoric-vapors","traits":["olfactory","poison"]}],"slug":"euphoric-vapors","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","olfactory","poison"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"gVjmtnuuswKSu5m2","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687403198567,"modifiedTime":1687403258356,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Sizzling Slime","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Whenever the euphoria ooze takes fire damage, the radius of its euphoric vapors aura increases to 30 feet. It loses its immunity to bludgeoning damage. Everything within the aura, including the euphoria ooze, is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Concealed]{Concealed} by smoke, and all creatures outside the smoke are concealed to creatures within it. These effects all last for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"wdZyo3HHkO9rGZ5V","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687403285594,"modifiedTime":1687403304182,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Pseudopod","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"nApvJYau13oxRFvT":{"damage":"2d6+5","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":14},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"lB3m5CgdRZB36xrI","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687403320954,"modifiedTime":1687403335198,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Elastic Bounce","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The euphoria ooze's last action was a successful pseudopod Strike or a successful @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Shove]{Shove}, or the euphoria ooze is within 5 feet of a wall</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ooze bounces off either a wall or the creature it hit or pushed. It Strides twice. If it ends its movement within melee reach of at least one enemy, it can make a melee Strike against that enemy.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previo